   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF NPA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF barnplanen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to the weak institutional capacity within the Ministry of Social Affairs a part of the support to children in difficult circumstances have been channeled through UNICEF. The support will improve the capacity of the training of social workers and reintegration of orphanes in their homes or fosterhomes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">P&#xe5; grund av den svaga institutionella kapaciteten inom Socialministeriet har en del av anslaget till Barn med s&#xe4;rskilda behov kanaliserats via UNICEF. St&#xf6;det ska leda till &#xf6;kad kvalitet p&#xe5; socialarbetarutbildningen samt att barn p&#xe5; institution ska &#xe5;terintegreras i sina hem eller fosterhem.</narrative>
  </description>
